@startuml Box Replacement Process

title Process: changing the contents of an attested box
caption Target design. Decisions D3, X3, D13. Plan 16.

|Loader|
start
:Find that an attested box must change\n(expired item, refusal, re-split);
note right: an attested box is never edited or deleted

:Replace the box;

|Freedom|
:Void the old box;
:Revoke its QR code;
:Create a replacement and copy its items;
:Move its vehicle allocation, if any;
note right: all in one transaction

|Loader|
:Correct the replacement's items;
:Attest the replacement;
:Print its new label;

|Freedom|
if (Box was on an approved vehicle load?) then (yes)
  :Return the manifest to Proposed;
  :Vehicle's declarations become stale;
  |Administrator|
  :Re-approve the load;
  |Dispatcher|
  :Re-declare (06 Load change and re-declare);
else (no)
endif
stop

@enduml
